       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. CUSTRPT.
      *================================================================*
      * Sample ILE COBOL Program: CUSTRPT.CBLLE                        *
      * Built with IBM i TOBi (makei) -> *PGM (CBLLE) - Tier 70        *
      * Reads Customer Master (CUSTPF) and writes Report (ORDPRTF)     *
      *================================================================*
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       CONFIGURATION SECTION.
       SOURCE-COMPUTER. IBM-ISERIES.
       OBJECT-COMPUTER. IBM-ISERIES.
       INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
       FILE-CONTROL.
           SELECT CUST-FILE
               ASSIGN TO DATABASE-CUSTPF
               ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
               ACCESS MODE IS SEQUENTIAL
               RECORD KEY IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
               FILE STATUS IS WS-CUST-STATUS.
           SELECT RPT-FILE
               ASSIGN TO FORMATFILE-ORDPRTF
               ORGANIZATION IS SEQUENTIAL
               FILE STATUS IS WS-RPT-STATUS.

       DATA DIVISION.
       FILE SECTION.
       FD  CUST-FILE
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD.
       01  CUST-RECORD.
           COPY DDS-ALL-FORMATS OF CUSTPF.

       FD  RPT-FILE
           LABEL RECORDS ARE OMITTED.
       01  RPT-RECORD.
           COPY DDS-ALL-FORMATS OF ORDPRTF.

       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  WS-CUST-STATUS          PIC X(02) VALUE SPACES.
       01  WS-RPT-STATUS           PIC X(02) VALUE SPACES.
       01  WS-EOF-FLAG             PIC X(01) VALUE 'N'.
           88  END-OF-CUSTOMERS              VALUE 'Y'.

       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       MAIN-PARA.
           OPEN INPUT  CUST-FILE
                OUTPUT RPT-FILE.
           WRITE RPT-RECORD FORMAT IS "RPTHEAD".
           PERFORM UNTIL END-OF-CUSTOMERS
               READ CUST-FILE NEXT RECORD
                   AT END
                       SET END-OF-CUSTOMERS TO TRUE
                   NOT AT END
                       MOVE CORR CUSTR OF CUST-RECORD
                         TO RPTDTL-O OF RPT-RECORD
                       WRITE RPT-RECORD FORMAT IS "RPTDTL"
               END-READ
           END-PERFORM.
           CLOSE CUST-FILE
                 RPT-FILE.
           GOBACK.
